Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Security|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-runtime-action-portlet,test-runtime-parent-portlet|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|Test Runtime Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: Smoke
Description: This is a test case for LPS-56769.
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Runtime Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Test Runtime Parent|
	And Click at locator 'Button#EXECUTE'
	Then Alert view Success Message